phrase: populate final slots in place with value {count} {val}
slot: count int
slot: val int
test: list=1,2,3,4 count=2 val=9
expect: => i=2 r=0.0 ok=true s="filled 2 tail positions" errors=0 n=4 res=[1,2,9,9] cache=0 hits=0
